          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Rule Of Thumb",
          "text": "Data fits one node? Reach for Sentinel. Only reach for Cluster when memory or write throughput forces sharding on you."
        },
